flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read n/]
    B --> C{n = 0?}
    C -->|Yes| D[/Print 0/]
    D --> Z([Stop])
    C -->|No| E{n is negative?}
    E -->|Yes| F[/Print "−" and set n ← −n/]
    E -->|No| G[binary ← empty]
    F --> G
    G --> H{n > 0?}
    H -->|Yes| I[r ← n mod 2]
    I --> J[binary ← r + binary]
    J --> K[n ← n div 2]
    K --> H
    H -->|No| L[/Print binary/]
    L --> Z
